l,["zh-Hant"],[["最值得稱讚的是內用區還算乾淨明亮，冷氣也滿足，成人低消150所以，當一個人來用餐時它們店內擺的小資套餐菜單就不成立，店內的自助吧其實也沒甚麼能加，飲料就麥茶冬瓜檸檬跟可爾必思，所以170的醬油叉燒拉麵就是完完全全的台式拉麵，海帶芽（？）、玉米（？）、筍乾、叉燒、唐心蛋、和麵，叉燒吃起來也不是很好吃的叉燒，麵也沒有很彈性，總之混合在一起，我只能給這個麵開價120最高了，你們竟然收我170，著實被雷了，然後店內放韓流，太大聲了很吵，以上，不會再來",null,[0,223]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11233928790658947900/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTZFZZd2JFcGFWM1JRVkRJeFExTkhUakJOYlhNeFdrWnNTRkZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11233928790658947900/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTZFZZd2JFcGFWM1JRVkRJeFExTkhUakJOYlhNeFdrWnNTRkZWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11233928790658947900/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTZFZZd2JFcGFWM1JRVkRJeFExTkhUakJOYlhNeFdrWnNTRkZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11233928790658947900/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTZFZZd2JFcGFWM1JRVkRJeFExTkhUakJOYlhNeFdrWnNTRkZWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11233928790658947900/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTZFZZd2JFcGFWM1JRVkRJeFExTkhUakJOYlhNeFdrWnNTRkZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11233928790658947900/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTZFZZd2JFcGFWM1JRVkRJeFExTkhUakJOYlhNeFdrWnNTRkZWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,6397,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSdVYwbEpaV3RQVDIxQ1NHTjBNbXMxWkZsSFFVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x4551f970513fd53e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkRuV0lJZWtPT21CSGN0Mms1ZFlHQUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSdVYwbEpaV3RQVDIxQ1NHTjBNbXMxWkZsSFFVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSdVYwbEpaV3RQVDIxQ1NHTjBNbXMxWkZsSFFVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSdVYwbEpaV3RQVDIxQ1NHTjBNbXMxWkZsSFFVRRILMG